# Demo branches each ship a `.octopus-<demo>/` directory — Octopus's CaC
# enforces a unique base_path per project, so each demo project gets its
# own renamed clone of the mainline `.octopus/` tree. Most files inside
# are identical to main; only deployment_process.ocl and variables.ocl
# actually differ.
#
# Marking the renamed directories as linguist-generated tells GitHub to
# collapse them in PR diffs by default, so reviewers focus on the actual
# demo-specific changes (tofu, gitops, scripts) rather than scrolling past
# the OCL scaffolding. The files are still indexed and reviewable when
# expanded; this only changes the default-collapsed state.
.octopus-*/** linguist-generated=true
